# Files Prettier must not touch.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The plan documents (the reason this file exists)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# On 2026-07-31 a format-on-save pass rewrote docs/PLAN.md and docs/FRONTEND-PLAN.md
# and corrupted a line in the process: Prettier could not tell the `**` glob
# inside `` `lib/api/**` `` from bold emphasis, glued the code spans to the
# words next to them, and emitted a literal `\*\*`. The line stopped rendering.
#
# This is not fixable by configuration. Prettier deliberately exposes no option
# for markdown emphasis markers or table padding - the maintainers have
# declined to add one - and the escaping behaviour is a known bug class
# (prettier/prettier#3837). The only reliable control is to exclude the files.
#
# These documents are also hand-wrapped at 100 columns and use tables whose
# column widths were chosen for readability in a diff. Prettier repads them,
# which turns a one-line edit into a whole-table diff and buries the actual
# change during review.
# Gitignore syntax: this matches .md at every level, not just the root.
*.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# frontend/src/lib/api/schema.d.ts is regenerated by `npm run api:types` from the
# backend's /openapi.json. It is committed so drift shows up as a reviewable
# diff, and never hand-edited - so formatting it would add noise to every
# regeneration for no benefit. See docs/FRONTEND-PLAN.md.
frontend/src/lib/api/schema.d.ts

# Build artifacts and dependencies. Ignored by git too; listed here so an
# editor's format-on-save does not try to rewrite them if they are open.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
package-lock.json
